## Critical Rules

1. **WKT is ISOLATED** - Users with `wkt_student` role ONLY see /wkt/* routes
2. **Do NOT modify** existing Depo-Pro features (calendar, jobs, transcripts)
3. **Be CONSERVATIVE** with readiness scores - don't over-encourage
4. **Follow existing patterns** - check lib/supabase/, app/api/, components/ui/

